    state: {"segments":[["Rate · 1024 bit",64,"rate"],["Capacity · 576 bit",36,"capacity"]],"note":"1600 位状态摆成 5 plane × 5 lane × 64 bit；容量恒取 c = |h| + 64，摘要从 capacity 读出，因此原像界 min(2^|h|, 2^c) 恰好等于 2^|h|。"},
